{
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "units": "mm",
  "meta": {
    "title": "Z Drive Housing (graph twin)",
    "notes": "Golden twin of main.py (graph format 1.1): the same parameters, the same derivations and the same operations in the same order. main.py stays the oracle; y4d-spec --parity compares the two at the defaults and at every preset. Constants keep main.py's names and values, and their sources are main.py's: SKF 625-2RS1 (BEARING_OD 16, BEARING_W 5), MISUMI GPA 2GT (2019 MX p. 1340: P20_L 21, P20_W 13.3, P20_PD 12.73), the 80-tooth 2GT pulley (Spool3D 'Small': P80_L 18), Gates 2MR belting (BELT_B 1.52) and the 9 mm Z belt (Voron 2.4r2 guide p. 111, BELT_WIDTH), NEMA 17 (catalog nema-17-48mm: NEMA_HOLES 31, NEMA_PILOT 22, NEMA_HALF 42.3 / 2), ISO 7380-1 M5 (HEAD_DK 9.5, SCREW_D 5), MISUMI HFS5 2020 (SLOT_LIP_T 2, PROFILE 20), MISUMI HNTAP5-5 (TNUT_L 15); GAP, LIP, POCKET_CLEAR, LIP_HOLE, TOP_T, FLOOR_T, PULLEY_CLEAR, HOLE_CLEAR, HEAD_CLEAR, GRIP, TAB_W, MOUNT_X1, M3_CLEAR, TENSION, BELT_SLOT_MARGIN, ACCESS_D, EDGE, WALL_REACH and the key stations are main.py's labelled conventions. Z keeps main.py's literal 10.0 (the frame's half profile). Clamps max(lo, min(x, hi)) and the plain min/max of X0, X1 and the corner key's end are ternaries, because the expression dialect has no function calls. _cyl_y (makeCylinder along +Y) is an XZ profile_circle built at the origin, extruded along +Y (the XZ normal is -Y), turned -90 about y so the cylinder's seam sits at +Z where makeCylinder puts it, then translated into place; _cyl_z is an XY profile_circle extruded and translated to z0. _slot_y is cyl, union cyl, union box. Every loop (three walls, two mount screws, three bearing seats, the 2x2 motor screw slots) is unrolled in the script's order. `mirrored` selects the pure YZ reflection of the body, as body.mirror(\"YZ\") does."
  },
  "parameters": {
    "belt_offset": {"default": 13.0},
    "belt_plane": {"default": 17.5},
    "center_distance": {"default": 40.8},
    "big_pulley_od": {"default": 55.0},
    "mount_pitch": {"default": 20.0},
    "mirrored": {"default": false}
  },
